      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The population-genetic analysis of 235 families of arbitrarily selected probands has been performed. These were males, aged 40-59 years, examined for the determination of CHD risk factors. The association of genetic markers with lipid content and BP level in different sex and age groups has been observed."},
